<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Phase 26 · Mack Berserker · Steam Truck</title>
<style>
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
:root{
  --void:#000008;--forge:#06060e;--steam:#39ff14;--hydro:#00e5ff;
  --elec:#ffd700;--mech:#ff8c00;--brake:#ff6ec7;--ctrl:#b388ff;
  --therm:#ff6b35;--water:#40e0d0;--struct:#c0c8d0;--safe:#ff4500;
  --text:#e8eef4;--muted:#6080a0;--new:#00ffcc;--aegis:#c0a060;
  --bowl:#b87333;--inject:#00bfff;--exhaust:#ff6b35;--next:#ff00ff;
  --shaft:#D85A30;--tank:#8B6914;--gold:#FFD700;--berserker:#cc2200;
  --big:#ff2200;--boiler:#e8c060;--piston:#FFB300;
  --font-d:'Georgia',serif;--font-b:'Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif;
  --font-m:'Courier New',monospace;
}
body{font-family:var(--font-b);background:var(--void);color:var(--text);line-height:1.6;overflow-x:hidden}

.banner{position:relative;background:var(--void);border-bottom:2px solid #0d0d20;padding:4rem 2rem 3.5rem;text-align:center;overflow:hidden;}
.banner::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;
  background:radial-gradient(ellipse 120% 60% at 50% -20%,#cc220012,transparent),
    radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 40% at 20% 110%,#FFD70008,transparent),
    repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,transparent 80px,#ffffff01 81px),
    repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,transparent,transparent 80px,#ffffff01 81px);}
.phase-pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:var(--font-m);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.28em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--berserker);border:1px solid #cc220040;padding:8px 28px;border-radius:2px;margin-bottom:2rem;position:relative;}
.phase-pill::before{content:'';width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--berserker);box-shadow:0 0 20px var(--berserker);animation:blink 1.2s ease-in-out infinite;}
@@keyframes blink{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.05}}
.banner h1{font-family:var(--font-d);font-size:clamp(2.2rem,5.5vw,4.5rem);font-weight:400;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1.05;margin-bottom:1.5rem;}
.banner h1 .b{color:var(--berserker)}.banner h1 .g{color:var(--gold)}.banner h1 .s{color:var(--steam)}
.banner p{color:var(--muted);font-size:13.5px;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.95}
.banner strong{color:var(--boiler)}
.delta-box{display:inline-block;margin-top:1.5rem;background:var(--forge);border:1px solid #cc220030;border-left:3px solid var(--berserker);padding:.8rem 1.4rem;font-family:var(--font-m);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--berserker);text-align:left;max-width:980px;width:100%;}
.delta-box span{color:var(--muted);display:block;line-height:1.8}

.tab-nav-wrap{background:var(--forge);border-bottom:2px solid #0d0d20;position:relative;}
.tab-nav{display:flex;gap:0;overflow-x:auto;scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:#1a1a30 var(--forge);}
.tab-nav::-webkit-scrollbar{height:4px}.tab-nav::-webkit-scrollbar-track{background:var(--forge)}.tab-nav::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:#1a1a30;border-radius:2px}
.tab{flex:1 1 0;min-width:160px;padding:1.1rem .9rem;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--font-m);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;border-right:1px solid #0d0d20;transition:all .25s;color:var(--muted);border-bottom:3px solid transparent;white-space:nowrap;}
.tab:hover{background:#0a0a18;color:var(--text)}
.tab.active{background:#040408;}
.tab.t-boiler{color:var(--boiler);border-bottom-color:var(--boiler)}
.tab.t-piston{color:var(--piston);border-bottom-color:var(--piston)}
.tab.t-trans{color:var(--tank);border-bottom-color:var(--tank)}
.tab.t-drive{color:var(--new);border-bottom-color:var(--new)}
.tab.t-power{color:var(--elec);border-bottom-color:var(--elec)}
.tab.t-next{color:var(--next);border-bottom-color:var(--next)}

.panel{display:none;animation:fadein .35s ease}.panel.active{display:block}
@@keyframes fadein{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(6px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}

.wrap{max-width:1500px;margin:0 auto;padding:3.5rem 2rem}
.eyebrow{font-family:var(--font-m);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:.5rem}
.section-title{font-family:var(--font-d);font-size:1.7rem;font-weight:400;color:#fff;margin-bottom:.7rem;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.section-lead{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.95;max-width:1100px;margin-bottom:2rem}

.metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(130px,1fr));gap:1px;background:#0d0d20;border:1px solid #0d0d20;border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden;margin:2rem 0}
.metric{background:var(--forge);padding:1.4rem .8rem;text-align:center}
.metric .val{font-family:var(--font-d);font-size:1.9rem;line-height:1;margin-bottom:.3rem}
.metric .lbl{font-family:var(--font-m);font-size:9px;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.13em}

.schem{background:var(--void);border:1px solid #0d0d20;border-radius:3px;padding:1rem;overflow-x:auto;margin:1.5rem 0}

.g2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(360px,1fr));gap:1.4rem;margin:1.5rem 0}
.g3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:1.4rem;margin:1.5rem 0}

.card{background:var(--forge);border:1px solid #0d0d20;border-radius:3px;padding:1.6rem}
.card h3{font-family:var(--font-d);font-size:1rem;font-weight:400;color:#fff;margin-bottom:.7rem}
.srow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:11.5px;padding:.35rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #0a0a18;color:var(--muted)}
.srow:last-child{border-bottom:none}.srow .v{font-weight:600}

.badge{display:inline-block;font-family:var(--font-m);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:2px;margin-bottom:.7rem;border:1px solid}

.tbl{background:var(--void);border:1px solid #0d0d20;border-radius:3px;overflow-x:auto;margin:1.5rem 0}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px;min-width:600px}
thead{background:var(--forge)}
th{font-family:var(--font-m);font-weight:400;text-align:left;padding:.8rem 1rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;font-size:9px;border-bottom:2px solid #0d0d20;color:var(--struct)}
td{padding:.65rem 1rem;border-bottom:1px solid #0a0a18;color:var(--text);font-size:12px}
tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
tbody tr:hover{background:var(--forge)}

.warn-box{background:var(--forge);border:1px solid #0d0d20;border-left:4px solid var(--elec);border-radius:3px;padding:1.4rem;margin:1.5rem 0}
.warn-box h4{font-family:var(--font-m);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--elec);margin-bottom:1rem}
.warn-box li{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:.5rem;list-style:none;padding-left:1rem;position:relative}
.warn-box li::before{content:'⚠';position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--elec);font-size:10px}

.new-box{background:var(--forge);border:1px solid #0d0d20;border-left:4px solid var(--berserker);border-radius:3px;padding:1.4rem;margin:1.5rem 0}
.new-box h4{font-family:var(--font-m);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--berserker);margin-bottom:1rem}
.new-box li{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:.5rem;list-style:none;padding-left:1.2rem;position:relative}
.new-box li::before{content:'▶';position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--berserker);font-size:9px;top:2px}

.next-box{background:var(--forge);border:1px solid #0d0d20;border-left:4px solid var(--next);border-radius:3px;padding:1.4rem;margin:1.5rem 0}
.next-box h4{font-family:var(--font-m);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--next);margin-bottom:1rem}
.next-box li{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:.5rem;list-style:none;padding-left:1.2rem;position:relative}
.next-box li::before{content:'◆';position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--next);font-size:9px;top:2px}

.pass{color:var(--steam)}.fail{color:var(--safe)}.warn{color:var(--elec)}.isnew{color:var(--new)}.isnext{color:var(--next)}.igold{color:var(--gold)}

@@keyframes steamflow{to{stroke-dashoffset:-24}}
@@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:.35}50%{opacity:1}}
@@keyframes powerpulse{to{stroke-dashoffset:-16}}
@@keyframes spin{from{transform:rotate(0deg)}to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
@@keyframes glow{0%,100%{opacity:.1}50%{opacity:.4}}
@@keyframes waterflow{to{stroke-dashoffset:-16}}
@@keyframes aegisglow{0%,100%{opacity:.15}50%{opacity:.7}}
@@keyframes drivepulse{to{stroke-dashoffset:-24}}
@@keyframes heatpulse{0%,100%{opacity:.3}50%{opacity:1}}
@@keyframes exhaustflow{to{stroke-dashoffset:-20}}
@@keyframes berserkerpulse{0%,100%{opacity:.2}50%{opacity:.9}}

.a-steam{stroke-dasharray:8,4;animation:steamflow 1.8s linear infinite}
.a-pulse{animation:pulse 1.4s ease-in-out infinite}
.a-power{stroke-dasharray:6,3;animation:powerpulse 1.4s linear infinite}
.a-glow{animation:glow 2s ease-in-out infinite}
.a-water{stroke-dasharray:5,4;animation:waterflow 1s linear infinite}
.a-aegis{animation:aegisglow 2s ease-in-out infinite}
.a-drive{stroke-dasharray:10,4;animation:drivepulse 1.2s linear infinite}
.a-heat{animation:heatpulse 1.5s ease-in-out infinite}
.a-exhaust{stroke-dasharray:6,4;animation:exhaustflow 1.4s linear infinite}
.a-berserker{animation:berserkerpulse 1s ease-in-out infinite}

.footer{background:var(--forge);border-top:1px solid #0d0d20;padding:1.5rem;text-align:center;font-family:var(--font-m);font-size:10px;color:#2a0800;letter-spacing:.1em}
@@media(max-width:700px){.wrap{padding:2rem 1rem}.tab{min-width:130px;padding:.7rem .5rem}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="banner">
  <div class="phase-pill">Phase 26 · Mack Berserker · Multi-Bowl Flash Boiler · 3 ft Gold Pistons · Dual Tank Belt</div>
  <h1><span class="b">Mack</span> <span class="g">Berserker</span> <span class="s">Steam Truck</span></h1>
  <p>
    Phase 26 — <strong>Mack Berserker</strong> — heavy steam truck built on the Mack cab-over chassis visible in the Blender model.
    <strong>100 gallon front-mounted multi-bowl flash boiler</strong> — multiple Aegis-derived hemispherical copper bowls in a single large pressure vessel — maximum flash surface area for maximum sustained steam output.
    <strong>3 ft stroke gold steam pistons</strong> — largest piston stroke in the Miasma series — 3 foot stroke · bore to be confirmed in Phase 27 — gold anodised cylinder barrels — locomotive-scale power output.
    <strong>Transmission TBD Phase 27</strong> — carrier plate concept under development.
    <strong>Dual Tank Belt Chain Driveshafts</strong> — two ANSI #160 double strand longitudinal chains running in parallel from transmission output to rear bevel gear set — split torque load across two chains — rated for full Berserker torque range.
    Estimated torque at 90 PSI idle: <strong>~42,000 Nm</strong> — at 500 PSI maximum: <strong>~234,000 Nm</strong> — estimated peak horsepower: <strong>~3,100 HP at 500 PSI and 900 RPM</strong>.
    This is a semi truck. It does not need to be subtle.
  </p>
  <div class="delta-box">
    PHASE 26 — NEW VERSUS PHASE 25 (CHEVY MIASMA DECKER)
    <span>▶ Platform change — Chevy Impala replaced by Mack cab-over truck chassis — Blender model base confirmed as Mack Berserker 002</span>
    <span>▶ Boiler — 100 gallon multi-bowl flash boiler front-mounted in engine bay — multiple Aegis hemispherical copper bowls — design TBD Phase 27 — capacity scale-up ×10 vs Decker 9000</span>
    <span>▶ Pistons — 3 ft stroke gold anodised cylinders — largest stroke in the Miasma series — cylinder count and bore TBD Phase 27 — torque scaling confirmed below</span>
    <span>▶ Transmission — design TBD Phase 27 — carrier plate concept under study — HTD V2 concept from Phase 25 as starting reference — must handle minimum 42,000 Nm at idle</span>
    <span>▶ Drivetrain — Dual Tank Belt Chain — two ANSI #160 DS chains in parallel — replaces single chain from Decker 9000 — 2× torque capacity — dual bevel gear rear turn</span>
    <span>▶ Torque — estimated 42,000 Nm at 90 PSI · 116,000 Nm at 250 PSI · 234,000 Nm at 500 PSI — all estimates pending bore confirmation in Phase 27</span>
    <span>▶ Horsepower — estimated 3,100 HP at 500 PSI and 900 RPM — comparable to four Bugatti Chirons combined — from steam</span>
    <span>▶ Aegis Boiler Mark 1 concept fully carried forward and scaled — dome rivets · TIG corner trim · standpipe outlets · steam trap · expansion buffer · EWI mist — all Phase 23 learnings applied at 100 gallon scale</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="tab-nav-wrap">
  <div class="tab-nav" id="tabNav">
    <div class="tab t-boiler active" onclick="showTab('boiler',this)">🔥 Multi-Bowl Boiler<br><small style="font-size:7px">100 Gal · Multi-Bowl · Front Mount</small></div>
    <div class="tab t-piston" onclick="showTab('piston',this)">🟡 Gold Pistons<br><small style="font-size:7px">3 ft Stroke · Torque · HP Calc</small></div>
    <div class="tab t-trans" onclick="showTab('trans',this)">⛓ Transmission TBD<br><small style="font-size:7px">Carrier Plate · HTD Ref · Ph27</small></div>
    <div class="tab t-drive" onclick="showTab('drive',this)">🔗 Dual Tank Belt<br><small style="font-size:7px">Twin ANSI #160 · Bevel · Diff</small></div>
    <div class="tab t-power" onclick="showTab('power',this)">⚡ Power & Torque<br><small style="font-size:7px">Nm · HP · Pressure Table</small></div>
    <div class="tab t-next" onclick="showTab('next',this)">🔮 Phase 27 Prep<br><small style="font-size:7px">Bore · Trans Design · Dims</small></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ===================== BOILER TAB ===================== -->
<div class="panel active" id="panel-boiler">
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--boiler)">Diagram 1 · Multi-Bowl Flash Boiler — Phase 26 Concept</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">100 Gallon Front-Mounted Pressure Vessel · Multiple Aegis Hemispherical Copper Bowls · Maximum Flash Surface</h2>
  <p class="section-lead">
    The Phase 26 boiler is a <strong style="color:var(--boiler)">100 gallon multi-bowl flash boiler</strong> mounted in the front engine bay of the Mack Berserker cab-over chassis. The exact internal layout is not yet designed — Phase 27 will produce the full fabrication drawing — but the core concept is confirmed: <strong style="color:var(--boiler)">multiple Aegis-derived hemispherical copper bowls</strong> arranged inside a single large stainless steel pressure vessel, each with its own heater element beneath it, each with dome rivets throughout its concave face, each generating steam independently and feeding into a common steam collection manifold.
    All Phase 23 Aegis Boiler learnings are carried forward and scaled. The dome geometry, TIG fillet corner trim, standpipe dry-steam outlets, steam trap, expansion buffer, dual EWI mist injectors, PRV array, and fusible plug array all apply at this scale. The boiler occupies the full front engine bay — roughly the footprint a conventional Mack diesel engine would occupy, but significantly taller.
    A 100 gallon vessel at 90 PSI operating pressure with multiple bowl flash surfaces is estimated to sustain steam output sufficient to keep both 3 ft gold pistons at continuous maximum stroke rate — this is the design target the Phase 27 bowl count and heater array must validate.
  </p>

