  <h2 class="section-title" style="color:var(--next)">Phase 27 · Bore Confirmation · Boiler Bowl Count · Transmission Design · Full Blender Dims · Parts List</h2>
  <p class="section-lead">
    Phase 26 establishes the Mack Berserker platform, boiler concept, piston scale, drivetrain configuration, and torque/HP estimates. Phase 27 converts every TBD in this document into a confirmed specification. The three primary Phase 27 tasks are: confirm the piston bore and crankshaft geometry in Blender, design the boiler internal bowl array to sustain steam delivery at the confirmed bore and pressure, and design the carrier plate transmission. Everything else follows from these three.
  </p>

  <div class="next-box">
    <h4>◆ PHASE 27 PRIMARY TASKS — IN ORDER</h4>
    <ul>
      <li>Task 1 — Confirm piston bore in Blender — the 200mm estimate drives every other calculation — build the cylinder and crankshaft to correct scale in the Mack chassis model and confirm it fits — if bore must change due to chassis geometry all torque and chain spec numbers update accordingly</li>
